save_mfdb_setup_calibration
   _category.id              mfdb_setup_calibration
   _category.description
;     Append-only calibration snapshot for a detector channel within a
;     reading/processing setup.  Each row records the G-factor, l1, and l2
;     values that were current at a specific point in time, together with
;     the method used to determine them and an optional reference to the
;     MFDB artifact that produced them.
;
;     Rows are never updated or deleted; a new row is INSERTed each time
;     the calibration values are set, preserving the full history.
;
   _category.mandatory_code  no
   _category_key.name        "_mfdb_setup_calibration.id"

save__mfdb_setup_calibration.id
